Z||000000||LT1 Chop Top||09-20-2001||12:11 AM||||These are pics of my new Chop Top steering wheel from Ausfiero.  I wanted something that was as unique as the car itself, and was considering a MOMO commando, until Aus offered to do some searching and recommend this AutoTechnica (he also sells MOMO cheap!).  Aus was VERY helpful in locating the wheel, as well as getting a very good price.  The custom adaptor that Aus has fabricated is a perfect fit, as well as wonderful quality.  Aus also offered to have the adaptor chromed a few more $, but once it was finished, the shop charged him twice as much.....and he DIDN'T pass the cost on to me.  He stuck to his VERY low quoted price (shipping included) from the very beginning.  I highly recommend doing business with him, and certainly would not hesitate to again.  If you want all of the details of the cost, Ill leave it up to Jim to let you know.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheel3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheel2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Wheel1_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheel4.jpg"> <BR>The wheel came out a bit light in the pics....it is actually much darker, very good match.<P><BR>||||reg||10
